<v Jeremy Raff>I'm crammed in the backseat with Anita and Jenri in the car seat. He's got a little car seat for little kids. And Anita just turns to him and starts asking him all about what happened after they were separated.
<v Jeremy Raff>我被挤在后座和安妮塔以及坐在儿童座椅里的詹里一起。他有一个适合小孩子的安全座椅。安妮塔转过身，开始问他关于他们被分开后发生的一切。

