<v Jodi Goodwin>So Anita's asking him like, where did they go, where did they take Jenri after they were separated. And Jenri's telling her her
<v Jodi Goodwin>安妮塔问他去了哪里，分开后他们把他带到了哪里。詹里在告诉她——

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:47.750
<v Jodi Goodwin>[INTERPOSING VOICES]
<v Jodi Goodwin>[说话声重叠]

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:57.070
<v Jeremy Raff>--icebox, you know you sleep on a little mattress on the ground with a space blanket.
<v Jeremy Raff>——冰柜（icebox），你知道，你睡在地上的一张小床垫上，盖着空间毯。

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:15.080
<v Nadia Reiman>So Anita's asking him if there were lots of kids with him, and he says that he was cold, and so he turns and he says to someone, teacher, I'm cold, can I have a blanket. And that person, who I'm guessing is probably like an ICE officer or something, or a--
<v Nadia Reiman>安妮塔问他是否有许多孩子和他在一起，他说他很冷，所以他转过身对某个人说，老师，我很冷，能给我一条毯子吗。而那个人，我猜可能是ICE官员或者什么人，或者——

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.050
<v Jeremy Raff>Border patrol agent.
<v Jeremy Raff>边境巡逻探员。

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:39.010
<v Nadia Reiman>Someone there tells them, no, not yet. And then when they finally give him a blanket, Jenri's saying that he shared it with another kid. And his mom is like you shared it with another child. And he says, yep. And she says, that's really good, sweetie.
<v Nadia Reiman>那里的人告诉他们，不，还不行。当他们终于给他毯子时，詹里说他把它和另一个孩子分享了。他妈妈说，你把它和另一个孩子分享了？他说，是的。她说，那真的很好，亲爱的。

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:49.810
<v Jeremy Raff>Yeah, I mean, this is her first time seeing him, and I think she's just looking at him, trying to imagine what he's been through while she has not been able to be there with him.
<v Jeremy Raff>是啊，我的意思是，这是她第一次见到他，我想她只是看着他，试图想象他经历了什么，而她却没能和他在一起。

