<v Anita>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Anita>[西班牙语]

00:19:44.550 --> 00:20:28.740
<v Jeremy Raff>That went on late into the evening. But then, around 11:00 PM, things took a bit of a turn. Jenri was still really excited and wasn't going to sleep anytime soon. And one of the nuns came in to kind of settle everyone down, make sure they had everything they needed, you know, for the next day, leaving. And Jenri's like running all over the place, right, in this little room. And he eventually reaches for the TV, almost like he's going to rip the TV off the wall, so this nun says, oh, don't touch that, you know.
<v Jeremy Raff>这一直持续到深夜。但在晚上11点左右，事情发生了一点转折。詹里仍然非常兴奋，短时间内根本睡不着。其中一位修女进来想让大家安静下来，确保他们有第二天离开所需的一切。詹里在这个小房间里到处乱跑。他最终伸手去够电视机，好像要把电视机从墙上扯下来一样，所以这位修女说，噢，别碰那个。

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.950
<v Nadia Reiman>At the shelter, it was actually sisters, not nuns.
