00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:41.680
<v Jeremy Raff>And he just starts repeating, don't touch, no touching. No touching, no touching, over and over again.
<v Jeremy Raff>他开始不停地重复，“别碰，别碰。别碰，别碰”，一遍又一遍。

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.630
<v Jenri>No touch, no touch, no touch! No touch!
<v Jenri>别碰，别碰，别碰！别碰！

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:47.030
<v Sister>OK, I think it's time [INAUDIBLE] so we can take him out of here.
<v Sister>好了，我想该[听不清]了，这样我们就能把他带出去了。

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:56.790
<v Jenri>[SPEAKING SPANISH] [CRYING]
<v Jenri>[西班牙语] [哭泣]

